config KEYPAW_SIM_CAPTURE
    bool "native_sim RGB matrix frame capture"
    default y
    depends on ARCH_POSIX
    depends on LED_STRIP
    help
      A led_strip device that records the RGB matrix frames, plus the
      --effect/--capture native simulator command line options. Used by the
      offline preview harness to turn the module's effects into GIFs. Never
      built into real firmware: the module is only added to the build when the
      harness passes it in ZMK_EXTRA_MODULES, and this depends on ARCH_POSIX.
